      "id": "mrw.t14",
      "statements": {
        "f1": "The line maintenance handover event topic is mrw-handover-basalt. Shift coordinators subscribe to completed handover events.",
        "f2": "On 2026-03-19, the line maintenance handover event topic changed to mrw-handover-glacier to separate trial handovers from routine traffic.",
