      "id": "mrw.t15",
      "statements": {
        "f1": "The fuel sampling submissions lab endpoint is mrw-fuel-cypress.invalid. It accepts sample identifiers and chain-of-custody metadata.",
        "f2": "On 2026-05-07, the fuel sampling submissions lab endpoint changed to mrw-fuel-dahlia.invalid for a planned intake-system migration.",
