        "f3": "On 2026-08-26, the hangar bay access kiosk idle session timeout reverted to 15 min / mrw-nacre after the shorter interval interrupted supervised visitor check-ins."
      },
      "query": "What is the current idle session timeout for the hangar bay access kiosk?"
    }
  ],
